sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Controller as AccountQueryController
    participant Gateway as QueryGateway
    participant Handler as AccountQueryHandler
    participant Repo as JPA repositories
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Emitter as QueryUpdateEmitter

    par Account list
        Client->>Controller: GET /query/accounts/all
        Controller->>Gateway: GetAllAccountsQuery
        Gateway->>Handler: Dispatch query
        Handler->>Repo: accountRepository.findAll()
        Repo->>DB: SELECT accounts
        DB-->>Repo: Account rows
        Repo-->>Handler: List<Account>
        Handler-->>Controller: List<Account>
        Controller-->>Client: JSON account list
    and Account statement
        Client->>Controller: GET /query/accounts/accountsStatement/{accountId}
        Controller->>Gateway: GetAccountStatementQuery
        Gateway->>Handler: Dispatch query
        Handler->>Repo: findById(accountId)
        Handler->>Repo: findByAccountId(accountId)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT account + operations
        Handler-->>Controller: AccountStatementReponseDTO
        Controller-->>Client: Account and operation history
    end

    Note over Client,Emitter: Real-time operation streaming uses a subscription query and SSE.

    Client->>Controller: GET /query/accounts/watch/{accountId}
    Controller->>Gateway: subscriptionQuery(WatchEventQuery)
    Gateway->>Handler: Initial WatchEventQuery
    Handler-->>Controller: Empty initial AccountOperation (filtered out)
    Controller-->>Client: text/event-stream connection remains open
    Emitter-->>Gateway: AccountCreditedEvent or AccountDebitedEvent projection
    Gateway-->>Controller: Subscription update: AccountOperation
    Controller-->>Client: data: AccountOperation JSON
